          "text": "Subject: Professional Letter of Recommendation for Sarah Connor",
          "font": "Helvetica-Bold",
          "size": 11,
          "color": "#0f172a",
          "align": "left"
        },
        {
          "id": "el_salutation",
          "type": "text",
          "x": 45,
          "y": 275,
          "w": 300,
          "h": 15,
          "zIndex": 5,
          "text": "Dear Hiring Committee,",
          "font": "Helvetica",
          "size": 10,
          "color": "#0f172a",
          "align": "left"
        },
        {
          "id": "el_body_p1",
          "type": "text",
          "x": 45,
          "y": 305,
          "w": 505,
          "h": 85,
          "zIndex": 5,
          "text": "It is my absolute privilege to recommend Sarah Connor for a position with your organization. I have had the distinct opportunity to observe her work as a Lead Field Operations Specialist during several critical technical deployments, and I have consistently been impressed by her tactical problem-solving abilities, resilience under pressure, and leadership skills.",
          "font": "Helvetica",
          "size": 10,
          "color": "#334155",
          "align": "left"
        },
        {
          "id": "el_body_p2",
          "type": "text",
          "x": 45,
          "y": 395,
          "w": 505,
          "h": 85,
          "zIndex": 5,
          "text": "Sarah exhibits an exceptional capacity to adapt to rapidly changing environment parameters and lead complex projects from conception through to full execution. She possesses outstanding communication skills and holds a deep understanding of hardware systems integrity, security mitigation protocols, and strategic deployment architectures.",
          "font": "Helvetica",
          "size": 10,
          "color": "#334155",
          "align": "left"
        },
        {
          "id": "el_body_p3",
          "type": "text",
          "x": 45,
          "y": 485,
          "w": 505,
          "h": 70,
          "zIndex": 5,
          "text": "She has consistently demonstrated unmatched integrity, resourcefulness, and a strong work ethic. She works seamlessly within cross-functional teams and is often the primary stabilizing force during high-stress scenarios. She will undoubtedly bring immense value to any operation she joins.",
          "font": "Helvetica",
          "size": 10,
          "color": "#334155",
          "align": "left"
        },
        {
          "id": "el_close_block",
          "type": "text",
          "x": 45,
          "y": 570,
          "w": 300,
          "h": 80,
          "zIndex": 5,
          "text": "Sincerely,\n\n\n\nDr. Miles Bennett Dyson\nDirector of Special Projects",
          "font": "Helvetica",
          "size": 10,
          "color": "#334155",
          "align": "left"
        },
